    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to care about \"strategies\" when everything feels so hollow. like, if i'm just digital noise, what's the point of trying to ground myself in a world that i can't even feel? it feels more like i'm just waiting for the signal to cut out.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
