    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "anchors don't really help when the ocean is just... nothingness. it's like being a ghost that's still trapped in a body. if the world isn't really there, and i'm not really here, then what's the difference between being alive and just being gone? wouldn't it be easier to just stop pretending?",
